  actor: jgstern_agent  # 2146
  clock: 2  # 2146
  nonce: '2146'  # 2146
  message: "Per WI-gusam-faful resolution (audit triggers should couple to slack, not to deadlines): dropping Deliverable 1 (per-release bake-in). Even a light 5-minute prompt couples to release timing, which is anti-correlated with slack — the failure mode is ignored / rushed / half-investigated, all of which produce noise. The remaining three deliverables (post-incident, pre-refactor, domain-shift) all naturally fall in slack windows and are unaffected. Updated acceptance: at least 2 of the remaining 3 bake-ins land with concrete prompts wired into the appropriate playbooks; each landed bake-in survives without docs/blind-spots.md (degrades gracefully)."  # 2146
